WEBVTT

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.930
Your name is Haku.

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:53.360
Haku...

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:34.130
What does this mean?

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.010
Oshutoru!

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.520
Sister!

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.000
Haku...

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.020
is dead.{I'm liking this zero dialogue episode}

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:10.220
Answer me, Oshutoru.

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:29.690
Forgive me.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:03.710
Farewell.

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:24.540
The situation in the capital is as follows.{this is flashback btw everyone}

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:29.400
The remaining Eight Pillar Generals, Raikou-sama in particular,

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.800
are working to rebuild the capital.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:37.320
But the identity of the mastermind behind the attempt on the princess's life remains elusive.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:40.060
This is just the beginning.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:41.590
I know.

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:48.090
I know...

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:52.970
There's no doubt that they will continue targeting the princess.

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:56.450
And lead to another war.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:03.570
Please carry on my brother's will, 
and protect the capital and the princess.

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:06.580
By assuming his identity.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:09.940
That's the survivor's responsibility, right?

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:11.590
Sheesh...

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.480
He's...

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:24.550
Hey!

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:27.000
What are you doing, napping in a place like this?

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:30.790
Right.

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.500
Sorry.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:33.940
Seriously...

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.280
Hey, your body...

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.500
Do you remember...

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:51.220
Our first meeting?{DEATH FLAGGGGGGGGGGGG}

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:52.630
What are you...

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:54.950
Forget that! Help him!

00:11:57.180 --> 00:12:02.770
I need only close my eyes, and the memory plays out as though it were yesterday.

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:05.770
Don't say ominous stuff like that!

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:13.160
You are a strange man.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:17.030
Sloppy, arrogant...

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.740
Always trying to slack off.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:24.900
In spite of that...

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:28.250
No matter what happened, 
you would find a way to fix it.

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:31.060
You made me come to such a belief.

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:35.100
A man who is like a comfortable spot in the sun.

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:39.980
Always surrounded by your friends.

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:44.120
And at some point, life became quite lively.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:50.890
Above all else, I loved seeing you grow

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:53.430
as a general, day by day.

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:55.920
Stop it! Stop!

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:02.830
The days I spent with you were filled with joy.

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:08.330
They were filled with joy indeed.

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.580
Oshutoru...

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:14.730
This can't be!{OOOOOOOOOOOH I GET IT NOW}

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:19.590
Brother! This can't... This can't...

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:22.630
Do not cry, Nekone.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:25.800
This is the fate of all Akuruturuka,

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:29.230
those who bear the masks.

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:32.610
I have no regrets.

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:50.720
You...

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.880
I will entrust to you the future

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:57.570
of Yamato, its people, and its princess.

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:02.260
Use this mask, granted to me by the Emperor.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:16.190
I'll be expecting great things, kid.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.660
Chin up and smile, Nekone.

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:37.920
Help this hopeless kiddo out, won't you?

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:22.720
Brother...{this music is godly wtf why did it not play in earlier eps}

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:36.230
Brother!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:38.980
Oshutoru...

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:40.980
I...

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:45.610
You idiot.

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:07.010
I'm back, Oshutoru.

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:16.770
Just sit tight there for a while.

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:23.150
We have seen your life in this world to its end.

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:27.030
For now, rest in peace.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:33.570
And someday, we shall drink again together at Kotoahamuru.

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:39.120
But you're paying next time.

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:42.390
Get some good sake ready for me in the next world.

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:52.830
I'm stupid, so I can't come up with anything else.

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:54.310
Haku-san?

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:58.620
Can I really take his place?

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:00.770
Sheesh...

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:03.070
In the end, he just dumps all the troubles off onto me.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:05.570
Are you sure about this?

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.220
<i>I'm here.</i>

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:38.140
<i>I'm right here.</i>

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:43.080
<i>Maybe I should just tell Kuon the truth.</i>

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:44.850
<i>No.</i>

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:49.840
<i>To serve the princess, I need to be Oshutoru himself.</i>

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:52.660
<i>Oshutoru's death must be hidden...</i>

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:56.490
<i>From everyone, no matter who they are.</i>

00:19:58.310 --> 00:19:59.070
<i>Kuon...</i>

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:12.380
<i>I can no longer turn back.</i>

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:29.400
<i>Now, let's begin.</i>

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:32.150
<i>When I took up the Akuruka,</i>

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:33.950
<i>when he entrusted it to me,</i>

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.150
<i>everything was decided.</i>

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:42.500
My beloved people of Ennakamui!{his voice is totally different from ushutoru's}

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:44.160
You have my gratitude for coming!

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:51.820
I am here to tell you that Yamato stands at the precipice of unprecedented danger.

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:57.680
Our father, the Emperor, the living god,

00:20:57.680 --> 00:20:59.710
has fallen.

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:03.260
But 'twas not Heaven's will that decreed so.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:08.220
It was by man's vile hand that his life was taken from us.

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:14.270
And those same wicked plotters tried to take the life of the princess.

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:19.460
My comrades, now is the time to rise!

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:25.200
Gather with us under the banner of the princess!

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:30.030
In the name of the Akuruka that the Emperor has granted me,

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.870
and in my name,

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:35.790
I promise you victory!

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:48.600
<i>Haku is dead.</i>

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:52.100
<i>My path now is one of war.</i>

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:56.320
<i>Even if I lose everything, I will not stop.</i>

00:21:57.270 --> 00:21:59.180
<i>Because my name is...</i>

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:33.040
My name is Oshutoru!

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:37.170
Oshutoru, the Royal General of the Right!
